<section>
  <div class="container narrow">
    <h2>Not another diet</h2>
    <p>Most diets ask you to fight your appetite. Weight Release does the opposite: it helps you choose foods that satisfy you faster, hold you longer and keep your blood sugar steady. The body responds — usually quietly, week after week — until you stop thinking about weight altogether.</p>

    <h2>Who it is for</h2>
    <ul class="checks">
      <li>Adults carrying weight that affects energy, joints, sleep or self-image.</li>
      <li>People who have tried many diets and want to step off the cycle.</li>
      <li>People with metabolic concerns (PCOS, fatty liver, pre-diabetes) where weight is a contributing factor.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What's inside</h2>
    <ul class="checks">
      <li>A whole-food, plant-based eating framework that does not count calories.</li>
      <li>Hands-on meal building — breakfasts, lunches, dinners, snacks.</li>
      <li>Movement guidance you can actually keep up with.</li>
      <li>Group support and one-on-one coaching as needed.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="quote">
      <p>"For the first time in twenty years, I am not on a diet — and the weight is going."</p>
      <cite>— Weight Release alum (illustrative)</cite>
    </div>

